"Pixonaut for WooCommerce is not connected yet. <a href=\"%1$s\">Connect your "
"store to Pixonaut</a> to sell personalised products. <a href=\"%2$s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How connecting works</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce är inte anslutet än. <a href=\"%1$s\">Anslut din "
"butik till Pixonaut</a> för att sälja personaliserade produkter. <a "
"href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Så fungerar "
"anslutningen</a>"

