msgstr "En Pixonaut-automatisering lade tryckeribeställningen."

#. translators: %s: the automation's name in Pixonaut.
#: src/Fulfilment/AdoptedOrder.php:202
#, php-format
msgid "The Pixonaut automation \"%s\" placed the printshop order."
msgstr "Pixonaut-automatiseringen \"%s\" lade tryckeribeställningen."

#. translators: %s: link to the order.
#: src/Fulfilment/AttentionAlerts.php:62
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: a personalised item of order %s needs attention before it can go "
"to the printshop. The order notes say why."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: en personaliserad artikel i beställning %s behöver åtgärdas innan "
"den kan gå till tryckeriet. Beställningsanteckningarna förklarar varför."

#. translators: 1: refunded quantity, 2: ordered quantity, 3: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/CancelTriggers.php:118
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: %1$d of %2$d of \"%3$s\" refunded. Nothing was changed in "
"Pixonaut: only a refund of the whole item cancels it there."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: %1$d av %2$d st. \"%3$s\" återbetalades. Inget ändrades i "
"Pixonaut: bara en återbetalning av hela artikeln avbryter den där."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:361
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%s\" was not sent: the store is not connected "
"to the Pixonaut workspace the order was placed under. Update the order once "
"it is connected to send it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: den nya adressen för \"%s\" skickades inte: butiken är inte "
"ansluten till den Pixonaut-arbetsyta som beställningen lades under. "
"Uppdatera beställningen när butiken är ansluten för att skicka den."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:380
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop: it needs "
"a name, a street, a city and a country."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: den nya adressen för \"%s\" skickades inte till tryckeriet: den "
"behöver ett namn, en gatuadress, en ort och ett land."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:585
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: it is not known whether the new address of \"%1$s\" reached the "
"printshop: Pixonaut answered \"%2$s\". Update the order to send it again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: det är okänt om den nya adressen för \"%1$s\" nådde tryckeriet: "
"Pixonaut svarade \"%2$s\". Uppdatera beställningen för att skicka den igen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the printshop's answer.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:727
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop refused the new address of \"%1$s\": \"%2$s\". It "
"ships to the address it had."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeriet avvisade den nya adressen för \"%1$s\": \"%2$s\". Den "
"skickas till den tidigare adressen."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:731
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop took the new address of \"%s\"."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tryckeriet tog emot den nya adressen för \"%s\"."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:733
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%s\" goes to the printshop with the order, "
"which it had not been sent yet."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: den nya adressen för \"%s\" följer med beställningen till "
"tryckeriet, eftersom den inte hade skickats än."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:735
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop refused the new address of \"%s\". It ships to the "
"address it had."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeriet avvisade den nya adressen för \"%s\". Den skickas till "
"den tidigare adressen."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:737
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut is telling the printshop the new address of \"%s\"."
msgstr "Pixonaut meddelar tryckeriet den nya adressen för \"%s\"."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the printshop order's status in Pixonaut.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:753
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%1$s\" was not sent: its printshop order is "
"past changing its address (\"%2$s\" in Pixonaut). It ships to the address it "
"had; ask the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: den nya adressen för \"%1$s\" skickades inte: dess "
"tryckeribeställning har kommit för långt för att adressen ska kunna ändras "
"(\"%2$s\" i Pixonaut). Den skickas till den tidigare adressen; kontakta "
"tryckeriet."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the printshop's name.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:759
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%1$s\" was not sent: its printshop, %2$s, "
"takes no address changes through Pixonaut. It ships to the address it had; "
"ask the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: den nya adressen för \"%1$s\" skickades inte: dess tryckeri, %2$s, "
"tar inte emot adressändringar via Pixonaut. Den skickas till den tidigare "
"adressen; kontakta tryckeriet."

#. translators: Fallback for a printshop name that is not known, inside an order note: "its printshop, the printshop, takes no address changes". Lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:762
msgid "the printshop"
msgstr "tryckeriet"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:766
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%s\" was not sent: its printshop needs a "
"postcode. Add one and update the order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: den nya adressen för \"%s\" skickades inte: dess tryckeri kräver "
"ett postnummer. Lägg till ett och uppdatera beställningen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:771
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%1$s\" was not sent: Pixonaut answered "
"\"%2$s\". It ships to the address it had."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: den nya adressen för \"%1$s\" skickades inte: Pixonaut svarade "
"\"%2$s\". Den skickas till den tidigare adressen."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:156
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was deleted in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Pixonaut: designen för \"%s\" raderades i Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:161 src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:199
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was deleted in Pixonaut, so the item cannot "
"be printed. Check the order with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: designen för \"%s\" raderades i Pixonaut, så artikeln kan inte "
"tryckas. Stäm av beställningen med kunden."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:193
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was changed in Pixonaut. The changed design "
"goes to approval again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: designen för \"%s\" ändrades i Pixonaut. Den ändrade designen "
"skickas för godkännande igen."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:198 src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:421
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was changed in Pixonaut after it was "
"approved, so it was not sent to the printshop. Check the design before it is "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: designen för \"%s\" ändrades i Pixonaut efter att den hade "
"godkänts, så den skickades inte till tryckeriet. Kontrollera designen innan "
"den trycks."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:205
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was changed in Pixonaut after it was "
"ordered. The printshop order is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: designen för \"%s\" ändrades i Pixonaut efter att den hade "
"beställts. Tryckeribeställningen är oförändrad."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:208
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was changed in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Pixonaut: designen för \"%s\" ändrades i Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:110
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. A plugin or the theme holds "
"it back (pixonaut_wc_fulfilment_can_fulfil)."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" skickades inte till tryckeriet. Ett tillägg eller temat "
"håller tillbaka den (pixonaut_wc_fulfilment_can_fulfil)."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:119
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. It was ordered under another "
"Pixonaut workspace than the one the store is connected to now."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" skickades inte till tryckeriet. Den beställdes under en "
"annan Pixonaut-arbetsyta än den som butiken är ansluten till nu."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:160
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. An earlier attempt sent its "
"printshop order under the cart's reference, so the store cannot tell whether "
"it was placed. Check the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" skickades inte till tryckeriet. Ett tidigare försök "
"skickade dess tryckeribeställning under varukorgens referens, så butiken kan "
"inte avgöra om den lades. Kontrollera beställningen i Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:178
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. The line has no design for "
"one of its sides."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" skickades inte till tryckeriet. Raden saknar design för en "
"av sina sidor."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:231
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. The line does not record how "
"the customer approved the design."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" skickades inte till tryckeriet. Det framgår inte av raden "
"hur kunden godkände designen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: Pixonaut order id.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:375
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: a Pixonaut automation already ordered \"%1$s\", as order %2$s. The "
"store took that order on instead of placing another."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: en Pixonaut-automatisering har redan beställt \"%1$s\", som "
"beställning %2$s. Butiken tog över den beställningen i stället för att lägga "
"en ny."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the reason Pixonaut gave.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" failed when it was placed: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%1$s\" misslyckades när den lades: %2$s"

#. translators: Fills in %2$s of an order note when the printshop order failed without a reason. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:453 src/Fulfilment/OrderFailed.php:84
msgid "no reason given."
msgstr "inget skäl angavs."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the order status Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:468
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" was placed with the status "
"\"%2$s\", which the store cannot go on from. Check the order with the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%1$s\" lades med statusen \"%2$s\", "
"som butiken inte kan gå vidare från. Stäm av beställningen med tryckeriet."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: number of attempts, 3: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:218
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop after %2$d attempts. "
"Pixonaut last answered \"%3$s\". Check the order in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" skickades inte till tryckeriet efter %2$d försök. "
"Pixonaut svarade senast \"%3$s\". Kontrollera beställningen i Pixonaut och "
"försök sedan igen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:316
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop. Pixonaut answered "
"\"%2$s\", and the store could not schedule another attempt. Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" skickades inte till tryckeriet. Pixonaut svarade \"%2$s\" "
"och butiken kunde inte schemalägga ett nytt försök. Försök igen med artikeln."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:346
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. The Pixonaut sandbox no longer knows its "
"design, print or order (\"%2$s\"); this happens when the sandbox's data was "
"reset. Place the item again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" behöver åtgärdas. Pixonauts sandbox känner inte längre "
"till dess design, tryck eller beställning (\"%2$s\"); det händer när "
"sandboxens data har återställts. Beställ artikeln igen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: the Pixonaut order the design already has, 4: what the merchant can do.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:355
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. Pixonaut refused it with \"%2$s\": its "
"design already has the Pixonaut order %3$s. %4$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" behöver åtgärdas. Pixonaut avvisade den med \"%2$s\": "
"dess design har redan Pixonaut-beställningen %3$s. %4$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: what the merchant can do.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:364
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. Pixonaut refused it with \"%2$s\". %3$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" behöver åtgärdas. Pixonaut avvisade den med \"%2$s\". %3$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the order's status in Pixonaut.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:201
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" is now \"%2$s\" in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%1$s\" har nu statusen \"%2$s\" i "
"Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:495
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" could not be sent again: the store could not schedule it. "
"Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" kunde inte skickas igen: butiken kunde inte schemalägga "
"det. Försök igen med artikeln."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:505
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" will be sent to the printshop again."
msgstr "Pixonaut: \"%s\" skickas till tryckeriet igen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the new Pixonaut order id.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:596 src/Fulfilment/OrderSubmitted.php:177
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was sent to the printshop again, as order %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" skickades till tryckeriet igen, som beställning %2$s."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the new Pixonaut order id, 3: its status.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:608
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was sent to the printshop again, as order %2$s, which is "
"\"%3$s\"."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" skickades till tryckeriet igen, som beställning %2$s med "
"statusen \"%3$s\"."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: what the merchant learned from the printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:638
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop has the order for \"%1$s\". %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: tryckeriet har beställningen för \"%1$s\". %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: what the merchant learned from the printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:664
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop does not have the order for \"%1$s\". %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: tryckeriet har inte beställningen för \"%1$s\". %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:686 src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:375
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderCancelled.php:73
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was cancelled."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" avbröts."

#. translators: Reason in an order note when a merchant rehearses a failed printshop order in the Pixonaut sandbox.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:706
msgid "Rehearsed in the Pixonaut sandbox."
msgstr "Simulerad i Pixonauts sandbox."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why Pixonaut refused, a full sentence or two.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:741
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop again. %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" skickades inte till tryckeriet igen. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:169
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" is not cancelled yet: the store could not schedule it. It "
"is not sent to the printshop meanwhile. Update the order to try again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" är inte avbruten än: butiken kunde inte schemalägga det. "
"Den skickas inte till tryckeriet under tiden. Uppdatera beställningen för "
"att försöka igen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:265
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: a design of \"%1$s\" could not be rejected in Pixonaut, which "
"answered \"%2$s\". It stays unapproved there, so it is not printed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: en design för \"%1$s\" kunde inte avvisas i Pixonaut, som svarade "
"\"%2$s\". Den förblir ej godkänd där, så den trycks inte."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was cancelled before it was sent to the printshop."
msgstr "Pixonaut: \"%s\" avbröts innan den skickades till tryckeriet."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:294
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" may have a printshop order, which was not cancelled: the "
"store is not connected to the Pixonaut workspace it was ordered under. Check "
"the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" kan ha en tryckeribeställning som inte avbröts: butiken är "
"inte ansluten till den Pixonaut-arbetsyta som den beställdes under. "
"Kontrollera beställningen i Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:361
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was not cancelled: the store is not "
"connected to the Pixonaut workspace it was ordered under. Cancel it in "
"Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" avbröts inte: butiken är inte "
"ansluten till den Pixonaut-arbetsyta som den beställdes under. Avbryt den i "
"Pixonaut."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why the printshop keeps the order.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:392
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" was not cancelled: %2$s Ask the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%1$s\" avbröts inte: %2$s Kontakta "
"tryckeriet."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:402
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was cancelled. Its printshop order had failed, so there was "
"nothing to stop at the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" avbröts. Dess tryckeribeställning hade misslyckats, så det "
"fanns inget att stoppa hos tryckeriet."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: Pixonaut's reason, if it gave one, with a leading space.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:415
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" could not be cancelled: Pixonaut "
"answered \"%2$s\".%3$s Ask the printshop to stop it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%1$s\" kunde inte avbrytas: Pixonaut "
"svarade \"%2$s\".%3$s Be tryckeriet att stoppa den."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:531
msgid "the printshop has made it already."
msgstr "tryckeriet har redan tillverkat den."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:533
msgid "the printshop has begun it and did not cancel it."
msgstr "tryckeriet har påbörjat den och avbröt den inte."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:535
msgid "its printshop cannot stop orders through Pixonaut."
msgstr "dess tryckeri kan inte stoppa beställningar via Pixonaut."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:537
msgid "its printshop is no longer connected to Pixonaut."
msgstr "dess tryckeri är inte längre anslutet till Pixonaut."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:539
msgid "the printshop cancelled it, but it shipped meanwhile."
msgstr "tryckeriet avbröt den, men den hade skickats under tiden."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:541
msgid "the printshop has it."
msgstr "tryckeriet har den."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:115
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused the printshop the item was sent to: only the printshop of "
"the product's blank can make it. Check the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut avvisade tryckeriet som artikeln skickades till: bara tryckeriet "
"för produktens grundprodukt kan tillverka den. Kontrollera grundprodukten i "
"Pixonaut och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:116
msgid ""
"The printshop that makes the item is disconnected in Pixonaut. Reconnect it "
"in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriet som tillverkar artikeln är frånkopplat i Pixonaut. Anslut det "
"igen i Pixonaut och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:117
msgid ""
"Pixonaut has no printshop to make the item: its design is on no blank, and "
"the workspace has no default printshop. Set one in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut har inget tryckeri som kan tillverka artikeln: dess design ligger "
"inte på någon grundprodukt, och arbetsytan har inget standardtryckeri. Ange "
"ett i Pixonaut och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:118
msgid ""
"The blank variant the item was bought as is retired in Pixonaut, so the "
"printshop cannot make it. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Grundproduktvarianten som artikeln köptes som har utgått i Pixonaut, så "
"tryckeriet kan inte tillverka den. Återbetala eller avbryt artikeln."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:120
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not tell which variant of the blank the item is: the product "
"sells no variant of its blank. Pick its variant on the product, then refund "
"or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte avgöra vilken variant av grundprodukten artikeln är: "
"produkten säljer ingen variant av sin grundprodukt. Välj variant på "
"produkten och återbetala eller avbryt sedan artikeln."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:122
msgid ""
"The item's print is at a size its position on the blank does not print, or "
"larger than the printshop's machine takes. Check the blank's positions and "
"the printshop's machine in Pixonaut, then have the customer personalise the "
"item again at a size it prints."
msgstr ""
"Artikelns tryck har en storlek som dess placering på grundprodukten inte "
"trycker, eller är större än tryckeriets maskin klarar. Kontrollera "
"grundproduktens placeringar och tryckeriets maskin i Pixonaut och låt sedan "
"kunden personalisera artikeln igen i en storlek som går att trycka."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:123
msgid ""
"The printshop's embroidery machine cannot stitch the item's design as it is, "
"for example a photo or a picture of too many colours. Check the design in "
"Pixonaut, then have the customer personalise the item again."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriets broderimaskin kan inte brodera artikelns design som den är, till "
"exempel ett foto eller en bild med för många färger. Kontrollera designen i "
"Pixonaut och låt sedan kunden personalisera artikeln igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:124
msgid ""
"The printshop's embroidery machine could not read the item's design. Check "
"the design in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriets broderimaskin kunde inte läsa artikelns design. Kontrollera "
"designen i Pixonaut och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:125
msgid ""
"The printshop charges a fee to set up the embroidery, and the fee has not "
"been accepted in Pixonaut. Accept it for the printshop in Pixonaut, then "
"retry."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriet tar ut en avgift för att förbereda broderiet, och avgiften har "
"inte godtagits i Pixonaut. Godta den för tryckeriet i Pixonaut och försök "
"sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:126
msgid ""
"The printshop needs a value the blank's variant or placement does not have. "
"Fill it in for the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriet behöver ett värde som grundproduktens variant eller placering "
"saknar. Fyll i det för grundprodukten i Pixonaut och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:127
msgid ""
"The design already has a printshop order in Pixonaut that this item did not "
"place, for example one placed in the studio. Check that order; if the item "
"is to be made as well, choose Order again anyway."
msgstr ""
"Designen har redan en tryckeribeställning i Pixonaut som den här artikeln "
"inte lade, till exempel en som lades i studion. Kontrollera den "
"beställningen; om artikeln också ska tillverkas, välj Beställ igen ändå."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:128
msgid ""
"The design's personal data was erased in Pixonaut, so it can no longer be "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"Designens personuppgifter har raderats i Pixonaut, så den kan inte längre "
"tryckas."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:130
msgid "The design changed in Pixonaut since the customer approved it."
msgstr "Designen har ändrats i Pixonaut sedan kunden godkände den."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:131
msgid ""
"The design was deleted in Pixonaut, so it can no longer be printed. Check "
"the order with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Designen raderades i Pixonaut, så den kan inte längre tryckas. Stäm av "
"beställningen med kunden."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:132
msgid ""
"The design was changed in Pixonaut after it was approved, so it was not sent "
"to the printshop. Check the design before it is printed."
msgstr ""
"Designen ändrades i Pixonaut efter att den hade godkänts, så den skickades "
"inte till tryckeriet. Kontrollera designen innan den trycks."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:133
msgid "Pixonaut no longer accepts the store's key. Reconnect the store."
msgstr "Pixonaut godtar inte längre butikens nyckel. Anslut butiken igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:134
msgid ""
"The design was changed in Pixonaut after the customer bought it, so their "
"proof no longer shows it. Check the design with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Designen ändrades i Pixonaut efter att kunden köpte den, så kundens "
"korrektur visar den inte längre. Stäm av designen med kunden."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:135
msgid ""
"The design was no longer waiting for the customer's approval when the order "
"was paid, for example because it was rejected in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Designen väntade inte längre på kundens godkännande när beställningen "
"betalades, till exempel för att den hade avvisats i Pixonaut."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:136
msgid ""
"The customer did not approve the design by the deadline, so it was rejected "
"and will not be printed. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Kunden godkände inte designen inom tidsfristen, så den avvisades och kommer "
"inte att tryckas. Återbetala eller avbryt artikeln."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:137
msgid ""
"The customer rejected the proof of the design, so it will not be printed. "
"Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Kunden avvisade korrekturet av designen, så den kommer inte att tryckas. "
"Återbetala eller avbryt artikeln."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:139
msgid "Pixonaut could not be reached, or kept failing. Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut gick inte att nå eller misslyckades upprepade gånger. Försök igen "
"med artikeln."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:140
msgid "The printshop order failed. Retry it, or cancel the item."
msgstr "Tryckeribeställningen misslyckades. Försök igen eller avbryt artikeln."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:141
msgid ""
"Pixonaut cannot tell whether the printshop received the order. Check with "
"the printshop, then tell Pixonaut whether it has the order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kan inte avgöra om tryckeriet tog emot beställningen. Kontrollera "
"med tryckeriet och meddela sedan Pixonaut om det har beställningen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:142
msgid "Check the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Kontrollera beställningen i Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:154
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was sent, but its answer was lost, "
"so Pixonaut cannot tell whether the printshop has it. Check with the "
"printshop, then settle it in the Pixonaut box of this order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" skickades, men svaret gick "
"förlorat, så Pixonaut kan inte avgöra om tryckeriet har den. Kontrollera med "
"tryckeriet och reda sedan ut det i Pixonaut-rutan för den här beställningen."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderDeliveryChanged.php:121
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the delivery address of the printshop order for \"%s\" was changed "
"in Pixonaut. The address of this order was not changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: leveransadressen för tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" ändrades i "
"Pixonaut. Adressen på den här beställningen ändrades inte."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the reason Pixonaut gave.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderFailed.php:81
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" failed: %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%1$s\" misslyckades: %2$s"

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:138
msgid ""
"Pixonaut has taken the order and holds it. It has not been sent to the "
"printshop yet."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut har tagit emot beställningen och håller kvar den. Den har inte "
"skickats till tryckeriet än."

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:153
msgid "It has not been sent to the printshop yet."
msgstr "Den har inte skickats till tryckeriet än."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why it is held and when it goes ahead.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:155
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" is held. %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%1$s\" är kvarhållen. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:170
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because the Pixonaut "
"workspace upgraded its plan."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" släpptes eftersom Pixonaut-"
"arbetsytan uppgraderade sin plan."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:172
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because a new month "
"began on the free plan."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" släpptes eftersom en ny månad "
"började på gratisplanen."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:174
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" släpptes."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:179
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because the Pixonaut "
"workspace upgraded its plan, and goes on to the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" släpptes eftersom Pixonaut-"
"arbetsytan uppgraderade sin plan, och går vidare till tryckeriet."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:181
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because a new month "
"began on the free plan, and goes on to the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" släpptes eftersom en ny månad "
"började på gratisplanen, och går vidare till tryckeriet."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:183
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released, and goes on to the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tryckeribeställningen för \"%s\" släpptes och går vidare till "
"tryckeriet."

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:194
msgid "The Pixonaut workspace has used its free plan's orders for this month."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut-arbetsytan har använt gratisplanens beställningar för den här "
"månaden."

#. translators: %d: the free plan's orders a month.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:197
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace has used its free plan's %d order for this month."
msgid_plural ""
"The Pixonaut workspace has used its free plan's %d orders for this month."
msgstr[0] ""
"Pixonaut-arbetsytan har använt gratisplanens %d beställning för den här "
"månaden."
msgstr[1] ""
"Pixonaut-arbetsytan har använt gratisplanens %d beställningar för den här "
"månaden."

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:201
msgid ""
"It goes to the printshop when the workspace upgrades, or when the month "
"resets if the new month has room for it."
msgstr ""
"Den går till tryckeriet när arbetsytan uppgraderar, eller när månaden "
"återställs om den nya månaden har utrymme för den."

#. translators: %s: the date the month resets.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:204
#, php-format
msgid ""
"It goes to the printshop when the workspace upgrades, or when the month "
"resets on %s if the new month has room for it."
msgstr ""
"Den går till tryckeriet när arbetsytan uppgraderar, eller när månaden "
"återställs den %s om den nya månaden har utrymme för den."

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: status Pixonaut reported
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:194
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut reported the status \"%2$s\" for \"%1$s\", which this plugin "
"version does not know; nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut rapporterade statusen \"%2$s\" för \"%1$s\", som den här versionen "
"av tillägget inte känner till; inget ändrades."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:302
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was printed at the printshop."
msgstr "Pixonaut: \"%s\" trycktes hos tryckeriet."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:332
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was shipped."
msgstr "Pixonaut: \"%s\" har skickats."

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: carrier, tracking number and link
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:335
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was shipped. Tracking: %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" har skickats. Spårning: %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: carrier, tracking number and link. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderTrackingChanged.php:144
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: tracking was added for \"%1$s\": %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: spårning lades till för \"%1$s\": %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: new carrier, tracking number and link, 3: the carrier and tracking number before. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderTrackingChanged.php:146
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the tracking of \"%1$s\" was corrected to %2$s. It was %3$s."
msgstr "Pixonaut: spårningen för \"%1$s\" rättades till %2$s. Tidigare: %3$s."

#. translators: %s: the error code Pixonaut answered, e.g. order_at_printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:30
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused to place the order again with \"%s\". Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut vägrade lägga beställningen igen och svarade \"%s\". Inget ändrades."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:42
msgid "The print is still being made. Try again once it is finished."
msgstr ""
"Trycket håller fortfarande på att tas fram. Försök igen när det är klart."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:43
msgid ""
"The printshop order is no longer failed in Pixonaut, so it was not placed "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeribeställningen har inte längre statusen misslyckad i Pixonaut, så den "
"lades inte igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:44
msgid "The printshop has the order already, so it is not placed again."
msgstr "Tryckeriet har redan beställningen, så den läggs inte igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:45
msgid "The order was placed again already, by an earlier retry."
msgstr "Beställningen har redan lagts igen, vid ett tidigare försök."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:46
msgid ""
"The design changed in Pixonaut since its print was made, so the print is no "
"longer the design's. Check the design in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Designen har ändrats i Pixonaut sedan trycket togs fram, så trycket "
"motsvarar inte längre designen. Kontrollera designen i Pixonaut."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:47
msgid ""
"The print's files were deleted in Pixonaut, so it cannot be sent to the "
"printshop again."
msgstr ""
"Tryckets filer har raderats i Pixonaut, så det kan inte skickas till "
"tryckeriet igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:48
msgid ""
"The design has another printshop order in Pixonaut that this item did not "
"place, for example one placed in the studio. Check that order in Pixonaut, "
"and cancel it there or settle the item with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Designen har en annan tryckeribeställning i Pixonaut som den här artikeln "
"inte lade, till exempel en som lades i studion. Kontrollera den "
"beställningen i Pixonaut och avbryt den där, eller gör upp om artikeln med "
"kunden."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:49
msgid "The printshop is paused in Pixonaut. Resume it in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriet är pausat i Pixonaut. Återuppta det i Pixonaut och försök sedan "
"igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:53
msgid ""
"Pixonaut was busy with the order and changed nothing. Try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut var upptaget med beställningen och ändrade ingenting. Försök igen "
"om en stund."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:56
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer has the printshop order or its print. Check the order in "
"Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut har inte längre tryckeribeställningen eller dess tryck. Kontrollera "
"beställningen i Pixonaut."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:58
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not accept the request the store sent. Check the Pixonaut log "
"under WooCommerce > Status > Logs."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut godtog inte förfrågan som butiken skickade. Kontrollera Pixonaut-"
"loggen under WooCommerce > Status > Loggar."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:60
msgid ""
"The store's key may not place orders again in Pixonaut. Check the key in "
"Pixonaut, or reconnect the store."
msgstr ""
"Butikens nyckel får inte lägga beställningar igen i Pixonaut. Kontrollera "
"nyckeln i Pixonaut eller anslut butiken igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:61
msgid "Printshop orders are turned off for the workspace in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Tryckeribeställningar är avstängda för arbetsytan i Pixonaut."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:62
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace is suspended. Check its billing in Pixonaut, then "
"retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut-arbetsytan är avstängd. Kontrollera dess fakturering i Pixonaut och "
"försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:63
msgid ""
"The workspace's plan in Pixonaut allows no more of this. Check the plan in "
"Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Arbetsytans plan i Pixonaut har nått sin gräns. Kontrollera planen i "
"Pixonaut och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:65
msgid ""
"The printshop the order went to is no longer available in Pixonaut. Check "
"the printshop in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriet som beställningen gick till är inte längre tillgängligt i "
"Pixonaut. Kontrollera tryckeriet i Pixonaut och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:72
msgid ""
"The printshop cannot print the item as it is: it does not offer the print's "
"method or colour output, or the print file is too large for it. Check the "
"printshop and the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriet kan inte trycka artikeln som den är: det erbjuder inte tryckets "
"tryckmetod eller färgläge, eller så är tryckfilen för stor för det. "
"Kontrollera tryckeriet och grundprodukten i Pixonaut och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:81
msgid ""
"The item's prints do not fit the blank's placements in Pixonaut: a placement "
"the blank must print is empty, or prints share or miss one. Check the "
"blank's placements in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Artikelns tryck passar inte grundproduktens placeringar i Pixonaut: en "
"placering som grundprodukten måste tryckas på är tom, eller så delar flera "
"tryck på en placering eller saknar en. Kontrollera grundproduktens "
"placeringar i Pixonaut och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:86
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused moving the order to another blank. Place it again as it is, "
"or move it in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut avvisade att flytta beställningen till en annan grundprodukt. Lägg "
"den igen som den är, eller flytta den i Pixonaut."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:87
msgid ""
"The delivery address lacks the postcode the printshop needs. Add it to the "
"order's shipping address, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Leveransadressen saknar det postnummer som tryckeriet behöver. Lägg till det "
"i beställningens leveransadress och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:88
msgid ""
"The saved address the order ships to is gone in Pixonaut. Check the order's "
"shipping address, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Den sparade adressen som beställningen skickas till finns inte längre i "
"Pixonaut. Kontrollera beställningens leveransadress och försök sedan igen."

#: src/Fulfilment/Shipments.php:89
