#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:47
msgid ""
"We use Pixonaut to personalise and print the products you design in our "
"store."
msgstr ""
"Vi använder Pixonaut för att personalisera och trycka de produkter du "
"designar i vår butik."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:48
msgid ""
"When you personalise a product, the text you type and the photos you upload "
"are sent to Pixonaut, which stores your design and makes its previews and "
"print files."
msgstr ""
"När du personaliserar en produkt skickas texten du skriver och bilderna du "
"laddar upp till Pixonaut, som sparar din design och skapar förhandsvisningar "
"och tryckfiler av den."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:49
msgid ""
"When you order a personalised product, your name, email address, phone "
"number and shipping address are sent to Pixonaut and to the printshop that "
"prints and delivers it."
msgstr ""
"När du beställer en personaliserad produkt skickas ditt namn, din e-"
"postadress, ditt telefonnummer och din leveransadress till Pixonaut och till "
"det tryckeri som trycker och levererar den."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:50
msgid ""
"Where the designer offers Pixel, Pixonaut's AI assistant, what you ask "
"Pixel, and the photos and design it works on, are sent to Pixonaut. Our "
"staff may also use Pixel to manage the store, which can include reading your "
"order and its details. Pixonaut processes what is sent to Pixel with AI "
"model providers."
msgstr ""
"Där designverktyget erbjuder Pixel, Pixonauts AI-assistent, skickas det du "
"frågar Pixel om, och de bilder och den design Pixel arbetar med, till "
"Pixonaut. Vår personal kan också använda Pixel för att sköta butiken, vilket "
"kan innebära att Pixel läser din beställning och dess uppgifter. Pixonaut "
"behandlar det som skickas till Pixel med hjälp av leverantörer av AI-"
"modeller."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:51
msgid ""
"Pixonaut erases your design and delivery details a number of days after your "
"order is finished. When you ask us to erase your personal data, they are "
"erased sooner, unless we keep them with your order or still need them to "
"deliver it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut raderar din design och dina leveransuppgifter ett visst antal dagar "
"efter att din beställning har slutförts. Om du ber oss radera dina "
"personuppgifter raderas de tidigare, om vi inte sparar dem med din "
"beställning eller fortfarande behöver dem för att leverera den."

#. translators: 1: URL of Pixonaut's privacy policy, 2: URL of Pixonaut's list of sub-processors.
#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:54
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut privacy policy: %1$s. Pixonaut's sub-processors: %2$s."
msgstr "Pixonauts integritetspolicy: %1$s. Pixonauts underbiträden: %2$s."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:60
msgid ""
"Personalised products are designed, proofed and printed through Pixonaut, so "
"the store sends Pixonaut the personal data below. Adapt this text to what "
"your store uses: leave out Pixel if you do not use it."
msgstr ""
"Personaliserade produkter designas, godkänns genom korrektur och trycks via "
"Pixonaut, så butiken skickar personuppgifterna nedan till Pixonaut. Anpassa "
"texten efter vad din butik använder: ta bort Pixel om du inte använder det."

#. translators: Label before the text WordPress suggests for the store's privacy policy.
#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:62
msgid "Suggested text:"
msgstr "Föreslagen text:"

#. translators: Error message of the proof REST route, shown to the shopper who opened a proof link.
#: src/Proofs/ProofRoute.php:131
msgid "This proof link is not valid."
msgstr "Den här korrekturlänken är inte giltig."

#. translators: Error message of the proof REST route, shown to the shopper who opened a proof link.
#: src/Proofs/ProofRoute.php:260
msgid "This proof is no longer available."
msgstr "Det här korrekturet är inte längre tillgängligt."

#. translators: Error message of the proof REST route, shown to the shopper who opened a proof link.
#: src/Proofs/ProofRoute.php:265
msgid "This proof cannot be shown right now."
msgstr "Det här korrekturet kan inte visas just nu."

#. translators: 1: required PHP version, 2: current PHP version.
#: src/Requirements.php:67
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce needs PHP %1$s or newer. This site runs PHP %2$s, "
"so the plugin is not running."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce kräver PHP %1$s eller senare. Den här webbplatsen "
"kör PHP %2$s, så tillägget körs inte."

#: src/Requirements.php:78
msgid ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce needs WooCommerce. Activate WooCommerce to use it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce kräver WooCommerce. Aktivera WooCommerce för att "
"använda det."

#. translators: 1: required WooCommerce version, 2: installed WooCommerce version.
#: src/Requirements.php:88
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce needs WooCommerce %1$s or newer. This site runs "
"WooCommerce %2$s, so the plugin is not running. Update WooCommerce to use it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce kräver WooCommerce %1$s eller senare. Den här "
"webbplatsen kör WooCommerce %2$s, så tillägget körs inte. Uppdatera "
"WooCommerce för att använda det."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:108
msgid "Default layout"
msgstr "Standardlayout"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:109
msgid ""
"How personalised products show the designer, unless a product overrides it."
msgstr ""
"Hur personaliserade produkter visar designverktyget, om inte en produkt "
"åsidosätter det."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:122
msgid "Designer language"
msgstr "Designverktygets språk"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:123
msgid ""
"The language of the designer on the product page, of Pixonaut’s designer the "
"Personalise button opens, and of the proof pages customers approve their "
"designs on. Following the site shows each visitor the site’s language they "
"browse in when Pixonaut has it, and the workspace’s default language when it "
"does not."
msgstr ""
"Språket i designverktyget på produktsidan, i Pixonauts designverktyg som "
"knappen Personalisera öppnar och på korrektursidorna där kunderna godkänner "
"sina designer. Med Samma som webbplatsen visas det för varje besökare på det "
"språk som besökaren använder på webbplatsen, om Pixonaut har det, och annars "
"på arbetsytans standardspråk."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing how the product page designer lays out its form. Admin product page.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:136 templates/admin/product-fields.php:164
msgid "Form layout"
msgstr "Formulärlayout"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:137
msgid ""
"How the designer lays out its form, on the product page and in Pixonaut’s "
"designer the Personalise button opens, unless a product overrides it: as the "
"template chose, every step on one page, or one step at a time."
msgstr ""
"Hur designverktyget lägger upp sitt formulär, på produktsidan och i "
"Pixonauts designverktyg som knappen Personalisera öppnar, om inte en produkt "
"åsidosätter det: som mallen har valt, alla steg på en sida eller ett steg i "
"taget."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: each product option, such as Size or Colour, gets a group of its own in the designer's form.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:149
msgid "As its own group"
msgstr "Som egen grupp"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:150
msgid ""
"Puts each of a product's options, such as Size or Colour, in a group of its "
"own in the designer's form on the product page, named after the option, in "
"the product's attribute order. Off, the options stay on top of the form, "
"unnumbered. A product whose groups were arranged by hand keeps them."
msgstr ""
"Lägger vart och ett av en produkts alternativ, till exempel Storlek eller "
"Färg, i en egen grupp i designverktygets formulär på produktsidan, namngiven "
"efter alternativet, i produktens attributordning. Av står alternativen "
"överst i formuläret, onumrerade. En produkt vars grupper ordnats för hand "
"behåller dem."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: whether the groups of a product's options come before or after the template's groups.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:161
msgid "Place of the option groups"
msgstr "Alternativgruppernas plats"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:162
msgid ""
"Whether the groups of a product's options come before or after the "
"template's groups."
msgstr ""
"Om grupperna för en produkts alternativ kommer före eller efter mallens "
"grupper."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: whether the designer's form numbers its groups.
#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing whether the designer's form numbers its groups. Admin product page.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:174 templates/admin/product-fields.php:183
msgid "Group numbers"
msgstr "Gruppnummer"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:175
msgid ""
"Numbers the groups of the designer's form on the product page: 1 Photo, 2 "
"Text on one page, Step 1 of 2 in steps. Off shows the group names with no "
"numbers."
msgstr ""
"Numrerar grupperna i designverktygets formulär på produktsidan: 1 Foto, 2 "
"Text på en sida, Steg 1 av 2 i steg. Av visar gruppernas namn utan nummer."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:186
msgid "Load other colours and views"
msgstr "Ladda andra färger och vyer"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:187
msgid ""
"Whether the designer loads a product's other colours, views and sides before "
"the customer picks one, so they show at once. Choose In the background or "
"Off for products with many large photos, or for customers mostly on phones."
msgstr ""
"Om designverktyget laddar en produkts andra färger, vyer och sidor innan "
"kunden väljer en, så att de visas direkt. Välj I bakgrunden eller Av för "
"produkter med många stora foton, eller för kunder som mest handlar i mobilen."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:200
msgid "Designer accent colour"
msgstr "Designverktygets accentfärg"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:201
msgid ""
"The colour the designer on the product page marks the chosen view, colour "
"and option in, and draws its Next button in. None takes the accent colour of "
"the store's brand in Pixonaut, and keeps the designer's own colours when the "
"brand has none."
msgstr ""
"Färgen som designverktyget på produktsidan markerar vald vy, färg och "
"alternativ med och ritar sin Nästa-knapp i. Ingen tar accentfärgen från "
"butikens varumärke i Pixonaut, och behåller designverktygets egna färger när "
"varumärket inte har någon."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:212
msgid "Custom accent colour"
msgstr "Egen accentfärg"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:213
msgid ""
"The accent colour when Designer accent colour is A custom colour, e.g. "
"#1e73be."
msgstr ""
"Accentfärgen när Designverktygets accentfärg är En egen färg, t.ex. #1e73be."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:224
msgid "Show the print area's frame"
msgstr "Visa tryckytans ram"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:225
msgid ""
"Draws a thin grey frame on the preview around where the design can go, in "
"the designer on the product page and in Pixonaut's designer the Personalise "
"button opens. Off, the design sits on the product photo as it will be "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"Ritar en tunn grå ram på förhandsvisningen runt det område där designen får "
"placeras, i designverktyget på produktsidan och i Pixonauts designverktyg "
"som knappen Personalisera öppnar. Avstängt ligger designen på produktfotot "
"som den kommer att tryckas."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant. "Hosted page" is Pixonaut's designer page the Personalise button opens.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:235
msgid "Add to cart after approve in hosted page"
msgstr "Lägg i varukorgen efter godkännande på Pixonauts sida"

#. translators: Help text of a setting on the settings page. "Approve and add to cart" and "Approve and go back" are the labels of the button on Pixonaut's designer page.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:237
msgid ""
"For the Personalise button layout. Approving adds the product to the cart "
"and opens its cart item's page, and Pixonaut's designer says Approve and add "
"to cart. Off, approving returns to the product page, and it says Approve and "
"go back."
msgstr ""
"För layouten med knappen Personalisera. Godkännandet lägger produkten i "
"varukorgen och öppnar sidan för raden i varukorgen, och Pixonauts "
"designverktyg säger Godkänn och lägg i varukorgen. Av: godkännandet leder "
"tillbaka till produktsidan, och det säger Godkänn och gå tillbaka."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: how the options of a product option such as a size show in the designer's form.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:248
msgid "Product options in the designer"
msgstr "Produktalternativ i designverktyget"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:249
msgid ""
"How the designer on the product page shows the options of a variable "
"product, such as its sizes, when it draws them in its form. As the theme "
"shows them (the default) keeps the theme's own field, and any swatches "
"another plugin draws in it. As swatches shows each option as a button like "
"the designer's own choices, an option that cannot be bought with the other "
"choices greyed out."
msgstr ""
"Hur designverktyget på produktsidan visar alternativen för en variabel "
"produkt, till exempel dess storlekar, när det visar dem i sitt formulär. Som "
"temat visar dem (standard) behåller temats eget fält, och de knappar som ett "
"annat tillägg ritar i det. Som knappar visar varje alternativ som en knapp, "
"likt designverktygets egna val. Ett alternativ som inte kan köpas med de "
"andra valen visas nedtonat."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:261
msgid "Use Pixonaut pictures as product images"
msgstr "Använd Pixonauts bilder som produktbilder"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:262
msgid ""
"Sets each personalised product’s and variation’s image to Pixonaut’s picture "
"of it, its template on the blank, and draws it again when the product "
"changes. A product can show its template’s showcase sets instead, chosen "
"under Product images in its Pixonaut tab. An image you set yourself is kept. "
"Off, each product gets back the image it had before."
msgstr ""
"Ger varje personaliserad produkt och variant Pixonauts bild av den, mallen "
"på grundprodukten, som produktbild och ritar om bilden när produkten ändras. "
"En produkt kan i stället visa mallens exempelset, som du väljer under "
"Produktbilder på produktens Pixonaut-flik. En bild du själv har angett "
"behålls. Avstängt får varje produkt tillbaka bilden den hade innan."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the fields are the ones the customer filled in to personalise the item.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:272
msgid "List the design's fields"
msgstr "Lista designens fält"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:273
msgid ""
"Lists what the customer filled in under a personalised item in the cart, the "
"checkout, their orders and the order emails, as the designer showed it. Off, "
"the item shows only its name. The order screen in the admin always lists "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Listar det kunden fyllde i under en personaliserad artikel i varukorgen, i "
"kassan, i kundens beställningar och i beställningsmejlen, så som "
"designverktyget visade det. Av visar artikeln bara sitt namn. "
"Beställningssidan i adminpanelen listar dem alltid."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: which view of the product the picture of a personalised item shows.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:284
msgid "Picture shows"
msgstr "Bilden visar"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:285
msgid ""
"A personalised item shows the customer’s design on the product in the cart, "
"the checkout, their orders and the order emails. This chooses the view of "
"the product it is drawn in: the one the customer previewed their design in, "
"or the first of the placement’s views the product is shown in."
msgstr ""
"En personaliserad artikel visar kundens design på produkten i varukorgen, i "
"kassan, i kundens beställningar och i beställningsmejlen. Här väljer du i "
"vilken vy av produkten den visas: den kunden förhandsvisade sin design i, "
"eller den första av placeringens vyer som produkten visas i."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:298
msgid "Default approval"
msgstr "Standardgodkännande"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:299
msgid ""
"How customers approve their design before it is printed, unless a product "
"overrides it."
msgstr ""
"Hur kunder godkänner sin design innan den trycks, om inte en produkt "
"åsidosätter det."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of days.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:313
msgid "Proof approval deadline (days)"
msgstr "Tidsfrist för godkännande av korrektur (dagar)"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:314
msgid ""
"With proof by email, how many days the customer has to approve their proof. "
"The link in the email works a week longer."
msgstr ""
"Med korrektur via e-post: hur många dagar kunden har på sig att godkänna "
"sitt korrektur. Länken i e-postmeddelandet fungerar en vecka längre."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:326
msgid "When no answer by the deadline"
msgstr "Om inget svar inom tidsfristen"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:327
msgid ""
"With proof by email, what happens to a design the customer neither approved "
"nor rejected by the deadline."
msgstr ""
"Med korrektur via e-post: vad som händer med en design som kunden varken har "
"godkänt eller avvisat inom tidsfristen."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; what happens to an item whose design the customer rejected.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:340
msgid "On deny"
msgstr "Vid avvisning"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:341
msgid ""
"What happens to an item whose design the customer rejected, or which was "
"denied at the deadline."
msgstr ""
"Vad som händer med en artikel vars design kunden avvisade, eller som "
"avvisades vid tidsfristen."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of days.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:355
msgid "First proof reminder after (days)"
msgstr "Första påminnelse om korrektur efter (dagar)"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:356
msgid ""
"Days after the proof email that a customer who has not answered is reminded. "
"Only reminders before the deadline are sent."
msgstr ""
"Antal dagar efter e-postmeddelandet med korrekturet innan en kund som inte "
"har svarat påminns. Endast påminnelser före tidsfristen skickas."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of days.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:369
msgid "Then remind every (days)"
msgstr "Påminn sedan med intervall (dagar)"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:370
msgid "Days between one proof reminder and the next."
msgstr "Antal dagar mellan en påminnelse om korrektur och nästa."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of reminders.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:383
msgid "Proof reminders at most"
msgstr "Högsta antal påminnelser om korrektur"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:384
msgid ""
"How many reminders a customer gets at most; 0 sends none. The last one says "
"when the deadline is and what happens then."
msgstr ""
"Hur många påminnelser en kund får som mest; 0 skickar inga. Den sista anger "
"när tidsfristen går ut och vad som händer då."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL of the Pixonaut API.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:402
msgid "API base"
msgstr "API-basadress"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:403
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut API as the browser reaches it, e.g. a local Pixonaut. Empty "
"uses Pixonaut’s own. The store’s key is sent to this address."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut-API:t som webbläsaren når det, t.ex. en lokal Pixonaut. Tomt "
"använder Pixonauts eget. Butikens nyckel skickas till den här adressen."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL WordPress uses for the Pixonaut API.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:412
msgid "Server-to-server API base"
msgstr "API-basadress server till server"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:413
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut API as WordPress itself reaches it, when that differs from the "
"browser’s address (WordPress inside Docker, say). Empty uses the API base."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut-API:t som WordPress självt når det, när det skiljer sig från "
"webbläsarens adress (t.ex. WordPress i Docker). Tomt använder API-"
"basadressen."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL of the Pixonaut studio.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:422
msgid "Studio base"
msgstr "Studio-basadress"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:423
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut studio, where a connect is approved and the admin’s studio "
"links lead. Empty uses Pixonaut’s own."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut-studion, där en anslutning godkänns och dit adminpanelens "
"studiolänkar leder. Tomt använder Pixonauts egen."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL of the CDN the designer SDK loads from.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:432
msgid "CDN base"
msgstr "CDN-basadress"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:433
msgid ""
"Where the pinned designer SDK release loads from, e.g. Pixonaut’s staging "
"CDN. The release’s integrity is still checked. Empty uses Pixonaut’s own."
msgstr ""
"Varifrån den fastlåsta versionen av designverktygets SDK laddas, t.ex. "
"Pixonauts CDN för staging. Versionens integritet kontrolleras fortfarande. "
"Tomt använder Pixonauts eget."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the URL of a designer SDK script.
#. translators: Label of the field for the SDK script's URL, in developer tools.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:442 templates/admin/developer-tools.php:111
msgid "SDK script"
msgstr "SDK-skript"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:443
msgid ""
"Loads the designer SDK from this script, e.g. a local build, instead of the "
"pinned release from the CDN base. Its integrity is not checked. Empty loads "
"the pinned release."
msgstr ""
"Laddar designverktygets SDK från det här skriptet, t.ex. ett lokalt bygge, i "
"stället för den fastlåsta versionen från CDN-basadressen. Skriptets "
"integritet kontrolleras inte. Tomt laddar den fastlåsta versionen."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; turns on debug logging of the designer SDK.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:452
msgid "SDK debug"
msgstr "SDK-felsökning"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:453
msgid ""
"Logs every designer mount and its failures to the browser console. On the "
"storefront, only for logged-in store managers."
msgstr ""
"Loggar varje montering av designverktyget och dess fel i webbläsarens "
"konsol. I butiken endast för inloggade butiksägare."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; turns on a log of requests to Pixonaut.
#. translators: Heading of the table of recent requests to Pixonaut, in developer tools.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:462 templates/admin/developer-tools.php:149
msgid "Request log"
msgstr "Förfrågningslogg"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:463
msgid "Records the last 50 requests to Pixonaut, without keys or tokens."
msgstr ""
"Sparar de senaste 50 förfrågningarna till Pixonaut, utan nycklar eller token."

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:230 src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:243
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:317
msgid "Pixonaut settings"
msgstr "Pixonaut-inställningar"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:288
msgid "You are not allowed to change the Pixonaut settings."
msgstr "Du får inte ändra Pixonaut-inställningarna."

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:309
msgid "Your settings have been saved."
msgstr "Dina inställningar har sparats."

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:333
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Spara ändringar"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:430
msgid "The changes you made will be lost if you navigate away from this page."
msgstr "De ändringar du har gjort försvinner om du lämnar sidan."

#. translators: Tab of the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the settings for the designer on the store's product pages.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:533
msgid "Storefront"
msgstr "Butik"

#. translators: Tab of the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: how customers approve their designs, and the proof emails.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:536
msgctxt "settings tab"
msgid "Approval"
msgstr "Godkännande"

#. translators: Tab of the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: which releases of the plugin WordPress offers.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:539
msgctxt "settings tab"
msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Uppdateringar"

#. translators: Tab of the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the store's connection to its Pixonaut workspace.
#. translators: Heading of the Pixonaut connection card on the settings page.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:542 templates/admin/connection-card.php:104
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Anslutning"

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: how the designer on product pages looks and behaves.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:558
msgid "Product page designer"
msgstr "Designverktyg på produktsidan"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:559
msgid ""
"How the designer looks and behaves on product pages. A product’s Pixonaut "
"tab can change the layouts for that product."
msgstr ""
"Hur designverktyget ser ut och fungerar på produktsidor. En produkts "
"Pixonaut-flik kan ändra layouterna för just den produkten."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the images of personalised products.
#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: the product's images drawn by Pixonaut.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:565
#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:28
msgid "Product images"
msgstr "Produktbilder"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:566
msgid ""
"The image the shop, feeds, emails and search results show for a personalised "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Bilden som butiken, produktflöden, e-postmeddelanden och sökresultat visar "
"för en personaliserad produkt."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: how a personalised item shows in the cart, the checkout, orders and emails.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:572
msgid "Cart and orders"
msgstr "Varukorg och beställningar"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:573
msgid ""
"How a personalised item shows in the cart, the checkout, the customer’s "
"orders and the order emails."
msgstr ""
"Hur en personaliserad artikel visas i varukorgen, i kassan, i kundens "
"beställningar och i beställningsmejlen."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: how customers approve their design before it is printed.
#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing how customers approve their design (proof) before printing. Admin product page.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:579 templates/admin/product-fields.php:202
msgid "Approval"
msgstr "Godkännande"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:580
msgid ""
"How customers approve their design before it is printed. A product’s "
"Pixonaut tab can choose another way for that product."
msgstr ""
"Hur kunder godkänner sin design innan den trycks. En produkts Pixonaut-flik "
"kan välja ett annat sätt för just den produkten."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the approval mode where customers approve a proof sent by email.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:586
msgid "Proof by email"
msgstr "Korrektur via e-post"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:587
msgid ""
"For every product whose approval is Proof by email: how long customers have "
