#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:61
msgid "Whether customers design this product before they buy it."
msgstr "Om kunder designar den här produkten innan de köper den."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:63
msgctxt "checkbox on the product: customers personalise it"
msgid "Personalise"
msgstr "Personaliserbar"

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:66
msgid "Customers design this product with a Pixonaut template."
msgstr "Kunder designar den här produkten med en Pixonaut-mall."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:68
msgid ""
"Tick it to choose the blank it is printed on, its sides and their templates."
msgstr ""
"Markera rutan för att välja grundprodukten den trycks på, dess sidor och "
"deras mallar."

#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: the blank the design is printed on.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:74
msgid "Printed on"
msgstr "Trycks på"

#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: the blank the design is printed on.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:75
msgid ""
"The blank product the design is printed on, and which of its variants this "
"is."
msgstr ""
"Grundprodukten som designen trycks på, och vilken grundproduktvariant det "
"gäller."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:77
msgctxt "Pixonaut blank, the unprinted product a design is printed on"
msgid "Blank"
msgstr "Grundprodukt"

#. translators: Placeholder of the blank dropdown: the product has no blank, only a template. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:79
msgid "No blank: template only"
msgstr "Ingen grundprodukt: endast mall"

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:86
msgid ""
"The product the design is printed on, e.g. a T-shirt. Without one, customers "
"buy the template’s design alone, such as a poster or a card."
msgstr ""
"Produkten som designen trycks på, t.ex. en t-shirt. Utan en sådan köper "
"kunder bara mallens design, till exempel en affisch eller ett kort."

#. translators: Label of the printshop that makes the product's orders. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:89
msgid "Printshop"
msgstr "Tryckeri"

#. translators: Screen reader label of the locked printshop of a product on a blank. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:97
msgid "Printshop, decided by the blank"
msgstr "Tryckeri, bestäms av grundprodukten"

#. translators: Link to the Pixonaut studio where the merchant changes the blank's printshop. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:101
msgid "Change in Pixonaut"
msgstr "Ändra i Pixonaut"

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:105
msgid ""
"Where this product’s orders are made. Workspace default sends them to the "
"workspace’s default printshop."
msgstr ""
"Var produktens beställningar tillverkas. Med ”Arbetsytans standard” går de "
"till arbetsytans standardtryckeri."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:106
msgid "The blank decides where its prints are made."
msgstr "Grundprodukten avgör var dess tryck tillverkas."

#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: the product sides, such as front and back, each with its template.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:113
msgid ""
"Each side is one place on the blank customers design, with its template and "
"print sizes."
msgstr ""
"Varje sida är ett ställe på grundprodukten som kunder designar, med sin mall "
"och sina tryckstorlekar."

#. translators: Button that adds a product side. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:123
msgid "Add side"
msgstr "Lägg till sida"

#. translators: %d: most sides a product can have.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:129
#, php-format
msgid "Each placement can be one side, up to %d sides."
msgstr "Varje placering kan vara en sida, upp till %d sidor."

#. translators: %d: most sides Pixonaut's designer is built for.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:140
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut recommends at most %d sides. Each side is one more step in the "
"designer, and slows it down on the customer’s device."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut rekommenderar högst %d sidor. Varje sida är ytterligare ett steg i "
"designverktyget och gör det långsammare på kundens enhet."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:148
msgid "A product without a blank has one side. Choose a blank to give it more."
msgstr ""
"En produkt utan grundprodukt har en sida. Välj en grundprodukt för att ge "
"den fler."

#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: how customers open the designer and approve their design.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:152
msgid "On the product page"
msgstr "På produktsidan"

#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: how customers open the designer and approve their design.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:153
msgid ""
"How customers open the designer, the photos they see their design on, and "
"how they approve it. Store default follows the Pixonaut settings page."
msgstr ""
"Hur kunder öppnar designverktyget, vilka foton de ser sin design på och hur "
"de godkänner den. Butikens standard följer Pixonaut-inställningarna."

#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing how customers open the designer on the product page. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:155
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Layout"

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:161
msgid "How customers open the designer on the product page."
msgstr "Hur kunder öppnar designverktyget på produktsidan."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:170
msgid ""
"How the designer on the product page lays out its form. The Personalise "
"button opens Pixonaut’s designer, which always follows the template."
msgstr ""
"Hur designverktyget på produktsidan lägger upp sitt formulär. Knappen "
"Personalisera öppnar Pixonauts designverktyg, som alltid följer mallen."

#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing where the product's options, such as Size or Colour, stand in the designer's form. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:174
msgid "Options in the form"
msgstr "Alternativ i formuläret"

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:180
msgid ""
"Where the product’s options, such as Size or Colour, stand in the designer "
"on the product page: on top of the form, or each in a group of its own named "
"after it. A side whose Groups you arranged keeps them."
msgstr ""
"Var produktens alternativ, till exempel Storlek eller Färg, står i "
"designverktyget på produktsidan: överst i formuläret, eller vart och ett i "
"en egen grupp namngiven efter det. En sida vars Grupper har ordnats behåller "
"dem."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:189
msgid ""
"Whether the designer on the product page numbers its groups: 1 Photo, 2 Text "
"on one page, Step 1 of 2 in steps. Off shows the group names with no numbers."
msgstr ""
"Om designverktyget på produktsidan numrerar sina grupper: 1 Foto, 2 Text på "
"en sida, Steg 1 av 2 i steg. Av visar gruppernas namn utan nummer."

#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing whether the designer's canvas keeps the template's proportions or takes the chosen print size's. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:193 templates/admin/product-side.php:271
msgid "Canvas shape"
msgstr "Designytans form"

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:199
msgid ""
"The shape customers design on when a print size’s proportions are not the "
"template’s. In the template’s shape, the canvas keeps its shape whatever "
"size is chosen, and the print is cropped to the size as the template fits "
"it; in the print size’s shape, the canvas changes shape with each size. Each "
"side can choose otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Formen på ytan som kunderna designar på när en tryckstorleks proportioner "
"inte är mallens. Med mallens form behåller designytan sin form oavsett "
"vilken storlek som väljs, och trycket beskärs till storleken på samma sätt "
"som mallen anpassas till den; med tryckstorlekens form ändrar designytan "
"form med varje storlek. Varje sida kan välja annorlunda."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:208
msgid "How customers approve their design before it is printed."
msgstr "Hur kunder godkänner sin design innan den trycks."

#. translators: Label of the views customers see their design in. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:212
msgid "Shown in"
msgstr "Visas i"

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:231
msgid "This placement has no views in Pixonaut yet."
msgstr "Den här placeringen har inga vyer i Pixonaut än."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:237
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:269
msgctxt "view of the design alone, without the product"
msgid "Design"
msgstr "Design"

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:242
msgid "The design alone, without the product"
msgstr "Designen ensam, utan produkten"

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:248
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be reached to list the blank’s views. The views chosen "
"before are kept."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte nås för att lista grundproduktens vyer. De vyer som "
"valts tidigare behålls."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:250
msgid "The blank’s views are listed once the product is updated with it."
msgstr "Grundproduktens vyer listas när produkten har uppdaterats med den."

#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:252
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:271
msgid ""
"Customers see their design in the views ticked here, and on its own in the "
"Design view when that is ticked. With none ticked, they see it in every view "
"of the blank and in the Design view. The designer opens on the starting "
"view, one of those ticked."
msgstr ""
"Kunder ser sin design i vyerna som är markerade här, och ensam i vyn Design "
"när den är markerad. Om ingen är markerad ser de den i alla grundproduktens "
"vyer och i vyn Design. Designverktyget öppnas på startvyn, som är en av de "
"markerade."

#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing which view the designer opens on. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:257
msgid "Starting view"
msgstr "Startvy"

#. translators: Option in the starting view dropdown: open on the first view of the blank. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-fields.php:259
msgid "The first view"
msgstr "Den första vyn"

#: templates/admin/product-not-connected.php:18
msgid ""
"This store is not connected to Pixonaut yet, so no blank or template can be "
"chosen here."
msgstr ""
"Butiken är inte ansluten till Pixonaut än, så ingen grundprodukt eller mall "
"kan väljas här."

#. translators: Link in the product's Pixonaut tab to the plugin's connection settings; here Connect is a verb.
#: templates/admin/product-not-connected.php:19
msgid "Connect the store"
msgstr "Anslut butiken"

#. translators: Link in the product's Pixonaut tab to the guide on linking products to Pixonaut.
#: templates/admin/product-not-connected.php:21
msgid "How linking products works"
msgstr "Så kopplar du produkter"

#: templates/admin/product-picture.php:22
msgid "Use the Pixonaut picture"
msgstr "Använd Pixonaut-bilden"

#: templates/admin/product-picture.php:23
msgid ""
"Your own image is shown. Pixonaut’s picture, its template on the blank, "
"takes its place again when you remove it."
msgstr ""
"Din egen bild visas. Pixonauts bild, mallen på grundprodukten, tar dess "
"plats igen när du tar bort den."

#: templates/admin/product-picture.php:25
msgid ""
"Pixonaut’s picture of this product, its template on the blank. It is drawn "
"again when the product changes. An image you set yourself is kept."
msgstr ""
"Pixonauts bild av den här produkten, mallen på grundprodukten. Den ritas om "
"när produkten ändras. En bild du själv har angett behålls."

#: templates/admin/product-picture.php:27
msgid ""
"Pixonaut’s picture of this product, its template on the blank, is set here "
"once it is drawn."
msgstr ""
"Pixonauts bild av den här produkten, mallen på grundprodukten, hamnar här så "
"snart den har ritats."

#: templates/admin/product-regenerate.php:24
msgid ""
"Regenerating the product image, its gallery pictures and its variations’ "
"images…"
msgstr ""
"Produktbilden, bilderna i produktgalleriet och varianternas bilder "
"återskapas…"

#: templates/admin/product-regenerate.php:25
msgid "The product image is regenerated. Reload the page to see it here."
msgstr "Produktbilden har återskapats. Ladda om sidan för att se den här."

#: templates/admin/product-regenerate.php:26
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not draw the product image. The product keeps the image it "
"has, and it is tried again later."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte rita produktbilden. Produkten behåller den bild den har, "
"och ett nytt försök görs senare."

#: templates/admin/product-regenerate.php:27
msgid ""
"The product shows an image you set yourself, which is kept. Its gallery’s "
"and variations’ Pixonaut pictures, if it has any, are drawn again. Use the "
"Pixonaut picture under Product image to show Pixonaut’s picture instead."
msgstr ""
"Produkten visar en bild som du själv har angett, och den behålls. Dess "
"Pixonaut-bilder i produktgalleriet och för varianterna, om den har några, "
"ritas om. Klicka på Använd Pixonaut-bilden under Produktbild för att visa "
"Pixonauts bild i stället."

#: templates/admin/product-regenerate.php:28
msgid "The product image could not be regenerated. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Det gick inte att återskapa produktbilden. Försök igen om en stund."

#: templates/admin/product-regenerate.php:45
msgid ""
"Draws the product image, its gallery pictures and its variations’ images "
"again from the template version and settings they use now: in background "
"jobs, or right away while this page stays open."
msgstr ""
"Ritar om produktbilden, bilderna i produktgalleriet och varianternas bilder "
"utifrån den mallversion och de inställningar de använder nu: i "
"bakgrundsjobb, eller direkt medan den här sidan är öppen."

#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:30
msgid ""
"Pixonaut pictures are not used as product images: turn on Use Pixonaut "
"pictures as product images in the Pixonaut settings for these to show."
msgstr ""
"Pixonauts bilder används inte som produktbilder: aktivera Använd Pixonauts "
"bilder som produktbilder i Pixonaut-inställningarna för att de ska visas."

#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:35
msgid ""
"While no showcase set is ticked, the product image is the template with its "
"own defaults. Choose what it is drawn on: the photo the product page starts "
"on, any photo of the blank, such as a scene, even of a view customers are "
"not shown, or the design alone. The designer still starts on its own "
"starting view."
msgstr ""
"Så länge inget exempelset är markerat är produktbilden mallen med sina egna "
"standardvärden. Välj vad den ritas på: fotot som produktsidan visar först, "
"valfritt foto av grundprodukten, till exempel en scen, även av en vy som "
"inte visas för kunderna, eller designen ensam. Designverktyget öppnas ändå "
"på sin egen startvy."

#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:40
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be reached to list the template’s showcase sets. The sets "
"chosen before are kept."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte nås för att lista mallens exempelset. De set som valts "
"tidigare behålls."

#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:42
msgid ""
"Show the template filled in with one of its showcase sets, example values "
"such as a real name or photo, instead of its placeholders. The first set "
"ticked is the product image, the others are added to the product gallery. "
"Customers still start designing from the template’s own defaults."
msgstr ""
"Visa mallen ifylld med ett av dess exempelset, exempelvärden som ett riktigt "
"namn eller foto, i stället för dess platshållare. Det första markerade setet "
"blir produktbilden och de övriga läggs till i produktgalleriet. Kunderna "
"börjar ändå designa utifrån mallens egna standardvärden."

#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:60
msgid ""
"This set is no longer in the template, so its image shows the template’s own "
"defaults. Untick it, or choose another set."
msgstr ""
"Det här setet finns inte längre i mallen, så dess bild visar mallens egna "
"standardvärden. Avmarkera det eller välj ett annat set."

#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:68
msgid ""
"The blank has no product photo for this side, so each set is drawn as the "
"design alone."
msgstr ""
"Grundprodukten har inget produktfoto för den här sidan, så varje set ritas "
"som designen ensam."

#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:70
msgid "The product has no blank, so each set is drawn as the design alone."
msgstr ""
"Produkten har ingen grundprodukt, så varje set ritas som designen ensam."

#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:75
msgid ""
"Listed for the template the first side was saved with. The images are drawn "
"again when the template is republished."
msgstr ""
"Seten listas för mallen som den första sidan sparades med. Bilderna ritas om "
"när mallen publiceras på nytt."

#. translators: %d: most showcase sets a product shows as its images. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:76
#, php-format
msgid "Up to %d sets are shown; those ticked after them are left out."
msgstr "Högst %d set visas; set som markerats efter dem tas inte med."

#. translators: Screen reader label of the dropdown that picks a print size for a side, on the admin product page, read by the merchant.
#. translators: Heading of the print size picker in the product page's designer, as Pixonaut's designer words it.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:41
#: templates/storefront/form-placeholder.php:380
msgid "Print size"
msgstr "Tryckstorlek"

#. translators: Option in a side's print size dropdown: use the print size the placement defines. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:42
msgid "Placement default"
msgstr "Placeringens standard"

#. translators: Option in a side's print size dropdown: enter an own width and height. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:43
msgid "Custom size"
msgstr "Egen storlek"

#. translators: Label of a custom print size's width field. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:50
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Bredd"

#. translators: Screen reader label of the custom print size's width field. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:51
msgid "Width in millimetres"
msgstr "Bredd i millimeter"

#. translators: Label of a custom print size's height field. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:54
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Höjd"

#. translators: Screen reader label of the custom print size's height field. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:55
msgid "Height in millimetres"
msgstr "Höjd i millimeter"

#. translators: Unit after a custom print size's width and height: millimetres. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:57
msgid "mm"
msgstr "mm"

#. translators: Placeholder of the field naming a print size, which customers see. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:58
msgid "Label, e.g. A4"
msgstr "Etikett, t.ex. A4"

#. translators: Screen reader label of the field naming a print size. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:58
msgid "Label customers see"
msgstr "Etikett som kunder ser"

#. translators: Radio button label on a print size: this size is chosen when the designer opens. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:63
msgid "Starts selected"
msgstr "Vald från start"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:71
msgid "Choose a template for this side."
msgstr "Välj en mall för den här sidan."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:72
msgid "Choose where on the blank this side is printed."
msgstr "Välj var på grundprodukten den här sidan ska tryckas."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:73
msgid "Enter the width and height in millimetres."
msgstr "Ange bredd och höjd i millimeter."

#. translators: Shown under a custom print size's width and height. %1$s: the largest width, %2$s: the largest height the side's placement prints, both in millimetres. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:74
#, php-format
msgid "Up to %1$s × %2$s mm"
msgstr "Upp till %1$s × %2$s mm"

#. translators: Error under a custom print size larger than the placement prints. %1$s: the largest width, %2$s: the largest height, both in millimetres. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:75
#, php-format
msgid "This placement prints at most %1$s × %2$s mm."
msgstr "Den här placeringen trycker högst %1$s × %2$s mm."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:79
msgctxt "product side such as front or back"
msgid "Side"
msgstr "Sida"

#. translators: Button that removes a whole side from the product. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:82
msgid "Remove side"
msgstr "Ta bort sida"

#. translators: Label of the fields naming a product side and its key. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:85
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Namn"

#. translators: Placeholder of the field naming a product side, which customers see. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:87
msgid "Name customers see, e.g. Front"
msgstr "Namn som kunder ser, t.ex. Framsida"

#. translators: Placeholder of the field for a side's key, a short lowercase identifier. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:88
msgid "Key, e.g. front"
msgstr "Nyckel, t.ex. front"

#. translators: Screen reader label of the field for a side's key. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:88
msgid "Side key"
msgstr "Sidans nyckel"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:90
msgid ""
"The name customers see on the side’s tab, and the key the cart and order "
"keep it under. Empty, both follow the placement."
msgstr ""
"Namnet som kunder ser på sidans flik, och nyckeln som varukorgen och "
"beställningen sparar den under. Om fälten är tomma följer båda placeringen."

#. translators: Label of the dropdown that picks the blank's placement (print area) a side is printed on. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:93
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "Placering"

#. translators: First option of the placement dropdown, nothing chosen yet. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:96
msgid "Choose a placement"
msgstr "Välj en placering"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:106
msgid "Where on the blank this side is printed."
msgstr "Var på grundprodukten den här sidan trycks."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:109
msgctxt "Pixonaut template that customers fill in"
msgid "Template"
msgstr "Mall"

#. translators: Placeholder of the template search dropdown. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:111
msgid "Search for a template"
msgstr "Sök efter en mall"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:119
msgid ""
"What customers fill in. With a blank, only templates that fit the placement "
"are listed."
msgstr ""
"Det som kunder fyller i. Med en grundprodukt listas endast mallar som passar "
"placeringen."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:122
msgid ""
"This template’s background shows through, and this product has no blank: "
"customers see the design on white paper in the designer, and it prints on "
"white paper. You probably want to set a background on the template in "
"Pixonaut. If transparent is what you intend, leave it as it is; customers "
"can still buy the product."
msgstr ""
"Mallens bakgrund är genomskinlig och produkten har ingen grundprodukt: "
"kunderna ser designen på vitt papper i designverktyget, och den trycks på "
"vitt papper. Du vill troligen ange en bakgrund på mallen i Pixonaut. Om "
"genomskinligt är avsikten kan du låta det vara som det är; kunderna kan ändå "
"köpa produkten."

#. translators: Label of the setting that keeps a product side on one version of its template. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:125
msgid "Template version"
msgstr "Mallversion"

#. translators: Checkbox on a product side: keep the side on the template version picked beside it instead of moving to each new version published. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:129
msgid "Stick to one version"
msgstr "Lås till en version"

#. translators: Option of a product side's template version picker: the template's latest published version. %d: its number, e.g. 3. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:132 templates/admin/product-side.php:143
#, php-format
msgid "Version %d (current)"
msgstr "Version %d (aktuell)"

#. translators: Option of a product side's template version picker. %d: the version's number, e.g. 2. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:133 templates/admin/product-side.php:145
#, php-format
msgid "Version %d"
msgstr "Version %d"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:154
msgid ""
"The side moves to each new version of the template when it is published, "
"keeping its groups and print sizes. Stuck to one version, it stays on it "
"until you change it here."
msgstr ""
"Sidan går över till varje ny version av mallen när den publiceras och "
"behåller sina grupper och tryckstorlekar. Låst till en version stannar den "
"på den tills du ändrar det här."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:162
msgid "Personalised: customers fill in the template"
msgstr "Personaliserad: kunder fyller i mallen"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:163
msgid "Standing: printed as the template is, with nothing to fill in"
msgstr "Fast: trycks som mallen är, utan något att fylla i"

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:165
msgid ""
"A standing side is printed from one design of the template, made when you "
"update the product. A product whose sides are all standing sells without the "
"designer."
msgstr ""
"En fast sida trycks från en design av mallen, som skapas när du uppdaterar "
"produkten. En produkt vars sidor alla är fasta säljs utan designverktyget."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:168
msgid ""
"This template offers fields to fill in. On a standing side customers do not "
"get to fill them in: it is printed as the template is."
msgstr ""
"Den här mallen har fält att fylla i. På en fast sida får kunderna inte fylla "
"i dem: den trycks som mallen är."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:171
msgid ""
"This template offers nothing to fill in, so customers have nothing to "
"personalise. Make the side standing to sell it as the template is."
msgstr ""
"Den här mallen har inget att fylla i, så kunderna har inget att "
"personalisera. Gör sidan fast för att sälja den som mallen är."

#. translators: %s: the option a blank's print areas change with, as the blank names it, e.g. "Size". Label of a standing side's previews, one per value of that option. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:183
#, php-format
msgid "Per %s"
msgstr "Per %s"

#. translators: %s: the option a blank's print areas change with, as the blank names it, e.g. "Size". Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/product-side.php:189
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The print area changes with %s, so each of its values is printed from its "
"own design of this side, made when you update the product. Check how it sits "
"on each, and adjust its layout by hand where it needs it: an adjusted value "
"keeps its layout when the side changes, until you reset it."
msgstr ""
"Tryckytan ändras med %s, så varje värde trycks från en egen design av den "
"här sidan, som skapas när du uppdaterar produkten. Kontrollera hur den "
"sitter på varje och justera layouten för hand där det behövs: ett justerat "
"värde behåller sin layout när sidan ändras, tills du återställer det."

#: templates/admin/product-side.php:192
msgid ""
"The previews appear when you update the product. An adjusted value keeps its "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"Förhandsvisningarna visas när du uppdaterar produkten. Ett justerat värde "
"behåller sin layout."

#. translators: 1: the option, e.g. "Size"; 2: its value, e.g. "XL". Alt text of a standing side's preview for one option. Admin product page.
